            "level": {
              "value": 1
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "Your body is designed to be particularly resilient. Your chassis is medium armor in the plate armor group that grants a +4 item bonus to AC, a Dex cap of +1, a check penalty of \u20132, a speed penalty of \u20135 feet, and a Strength value of 16. You can never wear other armor or remove your chassis; however, you still don't become fatigued from sleeping. Finally, you can etch armor runes onto your chassis as normal.\n\n**Chassis Deflection [reaction]**\nTrigger: A critical hit deals physical damage to you\nAttempt a DC 17 flat check. If you are successful, the attack becomes a normal hit.\n\nEnhancement Your chassis becomes difficult to overcome. You gain the Chassis Deflection reaction."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
